 "text": "\n\nAs an engineer, I've seen firsthand how healthy competition drives teams towards meeting project goals more efficiently.\nBy fostering individual strengths while encouraging group cohesion,\nwe tend to achieve better outcomes.\nThat being said,I still feel that overly intense competitive environments might overlook social dynamics,nurturing rivalry over unity.",
